id: pm-ado-github-5532dc4b9a65-33
title: Closeout records gap-reporting PR #16 as statement-enforcement delivery instead of #19
description: "GH issue #33: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/issues/33 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-17T08:42:43Z · updated 2026-10-17T08:42:43Z"
